    "part_1": "Heni Loukil.pdf | Contact www.linkedin.com/in/heni-loukil- aa4891240  (LinkedIn) Top Skills DevOps Deep Learning NestJSHeni Loukil Machine Learning Engineer at InstaDeep Sfax, Tunisia Experience InstaDeep Machine Learning Engineer January 2025-Present (1 year 2 months) ICube Strasbourg Geometric Deep Learning Intern February 2024-August 2024 (7 months) Strasbourg, Grand Est, France This Graduation Internship entitled",
